# New components for the V2 rebuild (started 2026-05-03) live in this folder.
# Old components are quarantined at ../components-legacy/ during the route-by-route
# migration. Once a new route is built and locked, its components either:
#   (a) live route-scoped in app/[locale]/<route>/_components/ if they're truly
#       single-route, or
#   (b) graduate to this folder if they're shared across multiple new routes.
# The first new shared primitive lands here when the second route needs it.
